<title>LATVIA: DEPOSITORY CONFIRMS LODE PROFIT, BONUS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>DEPOSITORY CONFIRMS LODE PROFIT, BONUS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian central depository on Wednesday confirmed that the Lode Brick general shareholders' meeting on March 14 decided to capitalise all of its 129,697 lats 1996 profit by issuing bonus shares.</p>
<p>All those who are Lode shareholders on April 2 will have the right to receive bonus shares, the depository said in a statement.</p>
<p>Lode is an active bourses secondary list share and saw its price jump for three consecutive days this week on the 1996 results and a preliminary announcement last week on the bonus isse.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
